OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPersistent
OL,6,Frain for evening, turning heavier at
OL,7,Ftimes, before clearing overnight, to
OL,8,Fleave only a few isolated showers come
OL,9,Fdawn, these mainly across the far
OL,10,Fwest. Brisk southerly winds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA day of showers mixed with
OL,13,Fbrighter spells, showers most frequent
OL,14,Facross western counties. More in the
OL,15,Fway of dry weather across the east.
