OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday brings brighter spells and
OL,7,Fscattered showers. Sunday sees showers
OL,8,For longer periods of rain and brisk
OL,9,Fsouth to southwest winds. Monday
OL,10,Fmainly dry with brighter spells.
